#: scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2699af9baa13a811bee786afad5f4faf12b3fc70c61db73e00bc0c996420d86
#. default-sha256: 90e465ef6bbbc9e92792c60de7e45d9632ad5cba7feabdf7866b662fdb0c965b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Besides, those who yearn for redemption have a tendency to latch on to the spiritual. "
"⟪k:2⟫I thought taking advantage of that would work to our benefit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Inoltre, coloro che cercano la redenzione tendono ad aggrapparsi alla spiritualità. "
"⟪k:2⟫Ho pensato che sfruttare questa cosa ci avrebbe aiutati."

