#: scenario8:scenario8_7AD4545B_43E2_48BB_83DC_EA12AA8AC13D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6ead2cd731149fca3573568c46d2ac222a082c7a66c14a0c89d7dfde27747b5
