msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nothing. ⟪k:3⟫I was about to say something incredibly cynical, but I caught myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Niente. ⟪k:3⟫Stavo per dire qualcosa di alquanto cinico,⟪k:4⟫ma mi sono trattenuto."

