msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I stopped thinking, stopped trying to make sense of the things inhabiting the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avevo smesso di pensare, e di cercare di dare un senso alle cose contenute nella casa."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D9031696_32C5_4F5B_AAC5_B715F70B4857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2237f7918405a6e2418a943cbb07be6db4e78d0ded949a1a5801d97bbb82115
