msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D9031696_32C5_4F5B_AAC5_B715F70B4857"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I was searching for a way to get you out of the tower,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I encountered "
"and spoke with the three men’s shadows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mentre stavo cercando un modo per tirarti fuori dalla torre, ho incontrato le "
"ombre dei tre uomini, e ho⟪k:3⟫parlato con loro."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2A975FD6_1987_4531_B499_8F70E26A3456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d5b7d4da449dc99b77334caf739e86c96ae2966796355fe0a7de6f5a2983228
