msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2A975FD6_1987_4531_B499_8F70E26A3456"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So I guess... ⟪k:3⟫our first task is to earn Mell’s trust."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quindi... ⟪k:3⟫immagino che il nostro primo compito⟪k:4⟫sia quello di guadagnarci "
"la fiducia di Mell."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7BB33D02_E8B5_4D6D_BA08_72D51A5A7020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b7728d26cf2a4a7a9c756254ed61d347a564d7a659ba98c1a70779373544a34
