msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7BB33D02_E8B5_4D6D_BA08_72D51A5A7020"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s death is in three days...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We have until then to get all three "
"keys..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mancano tre giorni alla morte di Morgana...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Abbiamo fino ad allora per "
"ottenere le tre chiavi..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7b8917da602a7088efe4956ffc2f3c4abd9fce02cac279b4861a628553c4c83
