msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It won’t be easy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I mean, we weren’t even present in this world until "
"today..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non sarà facile.⟪k:3⟫ Insomma, prima di oggi non eravamo nemmeno presenti in "
"questo mondo..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4293848C_4AD9_4E87_A2C6_4663BFA0DF86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80ab52f2c569de64b5edf4d3560f11cd0db5c1b1badcf3d9e385b8f105b2f025
